1
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:48,680
Tired?

2
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:52,520
Go to sleep.

3
00:01:59,000 --> 00:01:59,760
I'm really tired.

4
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,440
Stop it.

5
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:54,880
Honey,

6
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,240
I see you're sleeping deeply,

7
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,320
so I didn't wake you up.

8
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,880
I'm going to Fan State for a business trip,

9
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,040
and I'll be back in a few days.

10
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:02,600
Some men feel guilty

11
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,560
feel

12
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,440
guilty.

13
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,120
To cover up their cheating,

14
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,640
they become overly affectionate with their wives.

15
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,640
Ah.

16
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:18,880
Honey.

17
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,880
Why are you in France?

18
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,680
[The scent of an expensive perfume.]

19
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,040
[This smell seems familiar.]

20
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,960
What a beautiful bracelet.

21
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,000
Clive Christian.

22
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:54,880
Number one.

23
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,720
We're taking off.

24
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,880
We're taking off.

25
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,200
I'm dizzy.

26
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,840
Go to school first.

27
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,120
I'll play with you

28
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,000
when you get back.

29
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:09,760
Okay.

30
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,640
Go.

31
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,360
Give it to me.

32
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,160
What a surprise.

33
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,200
I didn't expect you to be so patient with children.

34
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,160
Are you like this with all children?

35
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,680
Or even the children of your enemies

36
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,080
can be used as pawns?

37
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,360
Do your own job well.

38
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,840
I don't have that much patience.

39
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:18,000
No, Jiang Li, this is too tight.

40
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,520
Make it a bit looser.

41
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,440
If it's any looser,

42
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,200
the dress won't hold its shape.

43
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,320
Is this really made to my measurements?

44
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,280
Maybe we should let it out another two centimeters.

45
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,120
Qianqian.

46
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,040
What's wrong?

47
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,280
You look so worried.

48
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,600
Is something on your mind?

49
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,560
Jiang Li,

50
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,640
do you recognize this bracelet?

51
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,360
It was designed by a young designer,

52
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,880
but she passed away.

53
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,840
What's wrong?

54
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,080
Nothing.

55
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,360
Nothing.

56
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,840
Your waist-to-hip ratio

57
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,680
is really enviable.

58
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,080
If I were a man,

59
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,800
I would definitely take you down.

60
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:55,520
Perfect makeup.

61
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,960
Tender hands.

62
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,600
The halo of the eldest daughter of the Lu family.

63
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,640
Be more confident.

64
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,040
Whether it was six years ago or now,

65
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,440
no matter who it was,

66
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,760
they would choose you,

67
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,400
not me.

68
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,040
We are best friends.

69
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,400
Of course, we are.

70
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,160
Relax.

71
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,360
Your wedding is in two days.

72
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,720
This is your first wedding,

73
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,680
and your last.

74
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,920
I'm leaving now.

75
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,640
Jiang Li, wait a moment.

76
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,400
Do you like this car?

77
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,120
This is...

78
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,480
A gift for you.

79
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:17,400
Go ahead,

80
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,040
what do you need me to do?

81
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,200
I just thought

82
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,480
you would need a car when you come back.

83
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,640
So...

84
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,440
You're not like this.

85
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,160
[Your brother-in-law might be cheating.]

86
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,720
[If it's true,]

87
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,400
[find this woman.]

88
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,960
[Why me?]

89
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:49,760
[Because you're a wild grass trying to climb out of the mud,]

90
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,040
[and I]

91
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,000
[can give you everything you want.]

92
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,920
[Isn't that right?]

93
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:56,680
[Including shares of Golden Thread.]

94
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,440
Cheers!

95
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,280
Pour the wine.

96
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,280
Come on.

97
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,760
Cheers.

98
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,000
Xiaorou,

99
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,000
this Chanel suit is tailor-made for you.

100
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,360
Of course.

101
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,440
Xiaorou is a career woman.

102
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,520
Look at this bracelet.

103
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,160
It's a full diamond model from Bvlgari.

104
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,080
You've never seen it, right?

105
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,720
It's over 300,000 yuan.

106
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,400
Bvlgari?

107
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,360
So beautiful!

108
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,040
This bracelet is the cheapest

109
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,760
on her.

110
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,360
And these earrings

111
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,200
from Graff,

112
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,480
worth eight figures.

113
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,480
Wow!

114
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,200
My goodness!

115
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,280
I'm so jealous!

116
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,080
It's stunning!

117
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,760
What business does Xiaorou do?

118
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,760
Take us with you.

119
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,200
Just a small business.

120
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,160
Today's drinks are on us.

121
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,200
Have a good time.

122
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:48,880
Come on.

123
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:51,360
To Xiaorou.

124
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,960
Cheers.

125
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,720
Come on, Xiaorou.

126
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,840
Let's go to the next place.

127
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,000
Ah.

128
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,880
You guys go ahead.

129
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,200
I left my lipstick in the private room.

130
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:11,920
I'll be there in a minute.

131
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,800
We'll go ahead.

132
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:13,720
Come quickly.

133
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,600
Okay.

134
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:15,560
We'll go ahead.

135
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,800
We'll order the wine first.

136
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,120
Bye.

137
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,360
Hurry up.

138
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:23,200
Ah?

139
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,080
Where did it go?

140
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,040
Did you see

141
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,960
an earring?

142
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:53,760
Earring?

143
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:54,680
No.

144
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,400
You go out first.

145
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,040
I'll finish cleaning soon.

146
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:02,800
Go out.

147
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,560
Li Sisi,

148
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,600
are you looking for this?

149
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,200
What are you doing here?

150
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,480
Have some water to sober up.

151
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,720
Chanel suit,

152
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:23,680
Graff's colored diamond earrings.

153
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,280
Your friends really have no taste.

154
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:30,480
This pair of pearls is worth millions.

155
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,040
Everything you're wearing,

156
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,280
except for your underwear

157
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,560
and Bvlgari bracelet,

158
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,440
must be Lu Qianqian's.

159
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,680
How do you know?

160
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,400
The car in front of the old house,

161
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,800
that's yours.

162
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,240
You're really the midnight Cinderella.

163
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,160
Li Sisi,

164
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,440
how do you know my old name?

165
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,520
You've looked into my background.

166
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,280
What do you want?

167
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,560
What do I want?

168
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,560
I haven't decided yet.

169
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,760
But I can pretend

170
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:14,280
I don't know about today.

171
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,760
You're so kind?

172
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,680
Of course not.

173
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,680
I have a condition.

174
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:21,880
You've been living in the Lu family

175
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,720
and Golden Thread for six years.

176
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:26,120
If you don't want Lu Qianqian to know,

177
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,720
you have to be obedient

178
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,760
and provide me with useful information.

179
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,160
By the way,

180
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,200
where did Zhou Jian go?

181
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,160
Who did he meet?

182
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:37,440
I know he didn't go to Fan State,

183
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:39,040
but changed his route halfway.

184
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,280
If you don't tell me,

185
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,360
I'll let Lu Qianqian ask you in person.

186
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,200
Mr. Zhou went to Bin Hai.

187
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:48,960
I heard that Mr. Zhuang would go to Bin Hai

188
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:49,920
for a vacation in the next few days.

189
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,960
I'll get in touch with you later.

190
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,800
Mr. Zhou is really well-informed.

191
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,320
You even know that I'm on vacation

192
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,880
in Bin Hai.

193
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,200
Mr. Zhuang, you are too kind.

194
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,840
I happened to be on a business trip in Er City,

195
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,120
and I heard from a friend that

196
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,880
you were on vacation nearby.

197
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,040
So,

198
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,560
I thought I'd come and see if I could meet you.

199
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:24,560
Annie,

200
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:25,600
you may not know,

201
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,960
but the chairman just had surgery,

202
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,560
and I haven't been bothering her much lately.

203
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,360
I'm actually quite embarrassed,

204
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,640
I was thinking of inviting you,

205
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:40,760
but you're the one who invited me.

206
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,680
I didn't expect you to invite me.

207
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:44,600
It doesn't matter.

208
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,600
I've invited some friends anyway.

209
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,240
They are not strangers.

210
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,360
Then let's just eat together.

211
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:51,600
I didn't expect to see

212
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,600
Mr. Shen here.

213
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:54,840
Nice to meet you.

214
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:56,920
I came to see my cousin-in-law

215
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:57,920
to discuss some family matters.

216
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,280
So I just came over uninvited

217
00:15:59,280 --> 00:15:59,960
to join the fun.

218
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:01,920
After all,

219
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:04,520
this isn't the first time Mr. Zhou and I have met.

220
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,240
Have we met before?

221
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,240
In the elevator.

222
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,560
Do you remember?

223
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,120
Ah.

224
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,520
Maybe Mr. Zhou was in a hurry at that time,

225
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:15,680
so you didn't notice me.

226
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,640
By the way,

227
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,520
when will your friend arrive?

228
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,120
Isn't it Mr Shen

229
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,720
that Mr Zhuang mentioned?

230
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,520
Jingmo is my family.

231
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,360
How could she be my friend?

232
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:34,720
She said she would come

233
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,720
after changing clothes.

234
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:36,880
She should

235
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:37,880
be arriving soon.
